# Title: Local Groups Discovery - Linux
# ID: 676381a6-15ca-4d73-a9c8-6a22e970b90d
# Status: test
# Level: low
# Author: Ömer Günal, Alejandro Ortuno, oscd.community
# Date: 2020-10-11
# Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1069.001
# Description: Detects enumeration of local system groups. Adversaries may attempt to find local system groups and permission settings
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((process_name:*/groups) OR ((process_name:*/cat OR process_name:*/ed OR process_name:*/head OR process_name:*/less OR process_name:*/more OR process_name:*/nano OR process_name:*/tail OR process_name:*/vi OR process_name:*/vim) AND cmdline:*/etc/group*))
